#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to use the Estimator primitive {#steps-to-use-the-estimator-primitive}"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah untuk menggunakan primitif Estimator {#steps-to-use-the-estimator-primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Mulakan akaun {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You first need to initialize your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "Anda perlu memulakan akaun anda terlebih dahulu. Anda kemudian boleh memilih QPU yang ingin anda gunakan untuk mengira nilai jangkaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup) if you don't already have an account.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah dalam [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud anda](cloud-setup) jika anda belum mempunyai akaun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"gate pecahan\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use the newly supported [fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates), set `use_fractional_gates=True` when requesting a backend from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance. For example:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan [gate pecahan](/guides/fractional-gates) yang baru disokong, tetapkan `use_fractional_gates=True` apabila meminta Backend dari instans `QiskitRuntimeService`. Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is an experimental feature and might change in the future.\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah ciri eksperimen dan mungkin berubah pada masa depan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create a circuit and an observable {#2-create-a-circuit-and-an-observable}"
msgstr "2. Cipta Circuit dan boleh pantau {#2-create-a-circuit-and-an-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit and one observable as inputs to the Estimator primitive.\n"
msgstr "Anda memerlukan sekurang-kurangnya satu Circuit dan satu boleh pantau sebagai input kepada primitif Estimator.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit and observable need to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr "Circuit dan boleh pantau perlu ditransformasi untuk hanya menggunakan arahan yang disokong oleh QPU (dirujuk sebagai Circuit *set seni bina arahan (ISA)*). Gunakan Transpiler untuk melakukan ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Initialize the IBM Quantum Estimator {#3-initialize-the-ibm-quantum-estimator}"
msgstr "3. Mulakan IBM Quantum Estimator {#3-initialize-the-ibm-quantum-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you initialize Estimator, use the `mode` parameter to specify the mode you want it to run in.  Possible values are `batch`, `session`, or `backend` objects for batch, session, and job execution mode, respectively. For more information, see [Introduction to IBM Quantum Compute Service execution modes](/guides/execution-modes). Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda memulakan Estimator, gunakan parameter `mode` untuk menentukan mod yang anda mahu ia jalankan. Nilai yang mungkin adalah objek `batch`, `session`, atau `backend` untuk mod pelaksanaan kumpulan, session, dan kerja masing-masing. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [Pengenalan kepada mod pelaksanaan IBM Quantum Compute Service](/guides/execution-modes). Perhatikan bahawa pengguna Pelan Terbuka tidak boleh menghantar kerja session.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Invoke Estimator and get results {#4-invoke-estimator-and-get-results}"
msgstr "4. Panggil Estimator dan dapatkan keputusan {#4-invoke-estimator-and-get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, invoke the `run()` method to calculate expectation values for the input circuits and observables. The circuit, observable, and optional parameter value sets are input as *primitive unified bloc* (PUB) tuples.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, panggil kaedah `run()` untuk mengira nilai jangkaan bagi Circuit dan boleh pantau input. Circuit, boleh pantau, dan set nilai parameter pilihan dimasukkan sebagai tupel *blok bersatu primitif* (PUB).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [test locally](local-testing-mode) before running on quantum computers.\n"
"- Review detailed [examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) guide.\n"
"- Learn how to [use the primitive options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- View the API for [Estimator](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Ketahui cara [menguji secara tempatan](local-testing-mode) sebelum menjalankan pada komputer kuantum.\n"
"- Semak [contoh](/guides/estimator-examples) terperinci.\n"
"- Amalkan penggunaan primitif melalui [pelajaran Fungsi kos](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) dalam IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Ketahui cara mentranspil secara tempatan dalam bahagian [Transpil](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Cuba panduan [Bandingkan tetapan Transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"- Ketahui cara [menggunakan pilihan primitif](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Lihat API untuk pilihan [Estimator](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
